350006	802	2022-11-25 01:03:03	1.   Aerial Testing of MARLIN-01 UAV. MARLIN-01 UAV platform is prepared for flight testing / launch trials and available for GBAD firing vide letter PN/NRDI/R AND D WING/03/3718153 dated 01 Aug 22. Subsequently, Post-flight data analysis will be undertaken for further consolidation of the platform.\r\n\r\n2.   Ground Testing of MARLIN-02 UAV. ATPs with relevant international standards duly qualifying the acceptance procedure for similar type of UAVs have already been forwarded to NHQ for perusal vide reference letter no. PN/HQ NRDI/R AND D WING/03/13317845 dated 21 May 22. Ground trials are successfully conducted on 20 Oct 22. Subsequently, aerial testing will be carried out.	DSensors	Finalized	2022-11-25 12:52:33	25	Oct 22	-19-25-	\N	f	\N
350018	803	2022-11-25 01:03:45	1.   Fabrication. Fabrication of all class A and class B antennas are completed based on finalized design. Fabrication and testing of weighted power divider is also completed. The results are analyzed using sophisticated RF equipment and found satisfactory. The antennas were powder coated to ensure ruggedness against marine climate.\r\n\r\n2.   Assembly of Complete Antenna Array. For initiating assembly of complete antenna array RADAR frame and supports have been received. Assembly of the complete antenna is in progress.\r\n\r\n3.   Power Splitters. 04 x 1:3 power splitters have been prepared and tested. Powder coating of the splitter enclosures is in progress. Final assembly will then be completed.	DSensors	Finalized	2022-11-25 12:53:14	25	Oct 22	-19-25-	\N	f	\N
300003	808	2022-12-06 01:16:51	1.   Various activities for the integration of basic sensor suite (depth sensor, temperature sensor, power/ voltage sensor, IMU sensor etc.) for prototype ROV have been completed.\r\n\r\n2.   Work is in progress on in-house development of a test platform (lab prototype) for evaluation of integrated performance of the propulsion system and the basic sensor suite.\r\n\r\n3.   Interfacing work of the test platform with prototype GUI console using different communication medium e.g. Ethernet and Fiber Optic Cable is in progress.\r\n\r\n4.   Design improvements in control system architecture based on system performance analysis conducted during the month of November 2022 are in progress.\r\n\r\n5.   Construction/ development work of the ROV test tank is in progress. EDC 31 Dec 22.	DNWS	Finalized	2022-12-28 03:09:14	25	Nov 22	-19-25-	\N	f	\N
