350012	810	2022-12-06 01:44:02	Milestones M1-5 have been successfully completed. Availability of PNS ASLAT and PNS YARMOOK, on which the dataloggers are installed, for a period of 06 months is required to acquire historical data for subsequent validation of already developed framework (M6). The Milestone M6 is “Validation of Framework and Development of GUI”. Availability of adequate data is vital for validation and robust operation of RUL algorithm. However, data acquisition efforts to date have been significantly hindered due to non-availability of PNS TABUK and PNS ASLAT since Nov 21. Therefore, NRDI INTELL requested NCMA vide reference PN/R AND D WING/GENERAL/1256716 dated 02 Nov 22 that new suitable PN platforms may be nominated that remains available for at least 06 consecutive months for data acquisition activity, which further leads to validation of already developed RUL prediction framework. NCMA has requested HQ COMLOG vide reference PN/NCMA/MAINTENANCE/1258558 dated 02 Nov 22 to approach HQ COMPAK to designate an OPV and a F-22P class ship for RUL project data collection and intimate date of first sea trip.	DSensors	Finalized	2022-12-28 03:09:54	25	Nov 22	-19-25-	\N	f	\N
