350014	790	2022-11-25 00:57:00	1.   Lab trials of GSP against already submitted ATPs have been conducted satisfactorily. All performance parameters were found to be within specified ranges.\r\n\r\n2.   Installation of GSP onboard PNS MOAWIN was carried out. \r\n\r\n       a.   Requisite cables of specified lengths were provided to ship staff for rigging. GSP Full Scale along with electronics box and mast have been installed on bridge top at the selected location. An industrial control casing has been designed and manufactured to integrate LoS VTS GUI and control for antenna director. The industrial control casing and receiver have been installed in bridge room. \r\n\r\n       b.   Testing of the entire system has been carried out in three phases as listed below:\r\n\r\n              (1)   System power on and chain test was carried out in harbor to validate proper communication between installed components.\r\n\r\n              (2)   Full chain testing with LoS VTS and GSP was carried out in harbor with P3C in air transmitting live video.\r\n\r\n              (3)   Full chain testing with LoS VTS and GSP was carried out in sea with P3C in air transmitting live video. All system components were found to be working satisfactorily. Good quality video was received throughout the testing range of 60-70 nautical miles and stabilization using GSP was achieved for the entire 4 hours run time. \r\n\r\n3.   The complete Raven II system was deployed successfully onboard PNS MOAWIN for LWF held on 28 - 29 Oct 22.	DSensors	Finalized	2022-11-25 12:48:06	25	Oct 22	-19-25-	\N	f	\N
