 the URD:\r\n\r\na)   Bandwidth: 1-3 GHz\r\nb)   Gain 8 dBi\r\nc)   Power Rating >300W\r\n\r\n3)   Thermal analysis of the high power antenna was also carried out in ANSYS Fluent, and results revealed safe operation at 500W.\r\n\r\n4)   The antenna is currently being fabricated.	DSensors	Edited	2020-10-12 11:34:25	38	Sep 20	-20-25-30-38-	\N	f	\N
