350005	302	2020-12-30 11:55:28	1.   Design Activities.\r\n\r\na.   In order to test the HST design concept and assess efficacy of various manufacturing techniques, a Scaled Down Model (SDM) of the HSTD is designed. The SDM will be loaded with different sensors / gauges for the acquisition of stress, vibration, and temperature data during the test flights. \r\n\r\nb.   Preliminary design of HSTD-SDM and detailed design activities of airframe components including; wing, empennage, fuselage, avionics system, control system & recovery mechanism is completed. The design integration activities are also completed. \r\n\r\nc.   Structural analysis is performed on the detailed design of HSTD-SDM using methods of Finite Element Analysis (FEA). The results showed minimum factor of safety of 2.0 under the maximum ‘g’ loading on the structure. Also, the assembly drawings and manufacturing plans are exported for subsequent manufacturing of UAV for ground / aerial testing. \r\n\r\nd.   Detailed test bench design for P-1000 and P-220 turbo jet engine is completed. The test bench will serve the purpose of ground testing / tuning of various operating parameters prior to integration with airframe. \r\n\r\ne.   UAV Launcher. The critical phase of pneumatic system and structural design is completed. The structural analysis of the designed structure and pneumatic system using FEA based techniques is under progress. Local industry is engaged for the manufacturing of the pneumatic actuator in lines with the INTELL design.\r\n\r\nf.   Pneumatic system test bench is also being designed for the UAV launcher. The test bench will serve the purpose of testing, evaluation and calibration of pneumatic circuit, actuator assembly and control system.\r\n\r\n2.   Hardware Procurement Status.\r\n\r\na.   Order is placed for procurement of JetCat P-1000 (Germany based 1100N) turbo jet engine. The procurement is under progress. \r\n\r\nb.   Order is placed for procurement of Veronte Flight controller of M/s Embention. The procurement is under progress.\r\n\r\nc.   Order is placed for procurement of JetCat P-220 (Germany based 220N) turbo jet engine for HSTD-SDM. The procurement is under progress. \r\n\r\nd.   Sample material for airframe manufacturing is procured. Plan for sample preparation and subsequent destructive testing (DT) & Non Destructive Testing (NDT) is also completed. The testing will be carried out using NRDI NDT center PNEC and PCSIR equipment. Consequently, the airframe material will be finalized based on the test results. \r\n\r\n3.   Way Forward. \r\n\r\na.   Testing of sample materials for airframe components will be carried out. The outcome of these activities will lead towards the 2nd iteration of critical design activities and design review / revision prior to design finalization activities. \r\n\r\nb.   HSTD-SDM will be manufactured and different sensors will be installed for subsequent ground / aerial testing and evaluation of design concept. \r\n\r\nc.   Modifications / improvements in the critical design of HSTD will be undertaken in lines with the outcomes of design, development and field testing of HSTD- SDM.\r\n\r\nd.   Ground testing of turbo-jet engine will be performed. An avionics test bench will be designed for the setup and integration of both onboard and ground avionics.	DSensors	Finalized	2021-01-06 12:54:49	25	Dec 20	-20-25-	\N	f	\N
