350005	324	2021-02-01 10:54:36	1.   Design Activities.\r\n\r\na.   In order to test the HST design concept and assess efficacy of various manufacturing techniques, a Scaled Down Model (SDM) of the HSTD, named HSTD-01, is designed. The SDM will be loaded with different sensors / gauges for the acquisition of stress, vibration, and temperature data during the test flights. \r\n\r\nb.   Detailed design, integration and computational analysis activities are completed. Also, the assembly drawings and manufacturing plans are exported for subsequent manufacturing of UAV for ground / aerial testing.  \r\n\r\nc.   Pattern manufacturing of airframe components is under progress. Pattern finishing and subsequent mold fabrication is also started on the completed patterns.\r\n\r\nd.   Detailed test bench design for P-1000 and P-220 turbo jet engine is completed. The test bench will serve the purpose of ground testing / tuning of various operating parameters prior to integration with airframe.\r\n\r\ne.   Final Design Report of HSTD system is completed and submitted to MTSS for onward submission to NHQ.\r\nf.   UAV Launcher. The final phase of pneumatic system and structural design is completed. The structural analysis of the designed structure and pneumatic system through FEA based techniques is also completed. The structural analysis shows sufficient factor of safety under critical operating conditions. Local industry is engaged for the manufacturing of the pneumatic actuator in lines with the INTELL design. \r\n\r\ng.   A SDM of UAV launcher is also being designed. SDM launcher will serve as test bench for pneumatic circuit of full scale UAV launcher. Testing, evaluation and calibration of pneumatic circuit, actuator assembly and control system will be carried out on the test bench.\r\n\r\n2.   Hardware Procurement Status.\r\n\r\na.   Order is placed for procurement of JetCat P-1000 (Germany based 1100N) turbo jet engine. The procurement is under progress. \r\n\r\nb.   Order is placed for procurement of Veronte Flight controller of M/s Embention. The procurement is under progress.\r\n\r\nc.   Order is placed for procurement of JetCat P-220 (Germany based 220N) turbo jet engine for HSTD-01. The procurement is under progress. \r\n\r\nd.   Material requirements for manufacturing of HSTD-01 and SDM launcher / pneumatic system test bench are finalized. Procurement minutes are being compiled for the same.\r\n\r\ne.   Sample material for composite material testing is procured. Plans for sample preparation and subsequent destructive testing (DT) & Non Destructive Testing (NDT) are also completed. The testing will be carried out using NRDI NDT center PNEC and PCSIR equipment.\r\n\r\n3.   Way Forward. \r\n\r\na.   Testing of composite material samples will be carried out. The outcome of these activities will lead towards the further consolidation of design activities.\r\n\r\nb.   Flight data acquisition system with various sensors will be developed and installed on-board HSTD-01 for subsequent ground / aerial testing and evaluation of design concept.\r\n\r\nc.   Modifications / improvements in the design of HSTD system will be undertaken in lines with the outcomes of design, development and field testing of HSTD-01. Likewise, design of full scale launcher will be further consolidated based on the experience gained from manufacturing and field testing of SDM launcher.\r\n\r\nd.   Manufacturing of jet engine test bench will be undertaken. The test bench will serve the purpose of ground testing / tuning of various operating parameters prior to integration with airframe.\r\n\r\ne.   Ground testing of turbo-jet engine will be performed. Also, an avionics test bench will be designed for the setup and integration of both; onboard and ground avionics.	DSensors	Finalized	2021-02-17 09:25:19	25	Jan 21	-20-25-	\N	f	\N
