350005	192	2020-09-29 11:21:19	1.   Design Activities.\r\na.   Design integration of wing, empennage and fuselage is undertaken and preliminary design phase is completed. Design iteration to optimize strength to weight ratio of wing and empennage is completed. \r\n\r\nb.   Critical design activities for wings, empennage, control surfaces and fuel tank have also been initiated. \r\n\r\nc.   Computer Aided Design (CAD) models of avionics components are generated for integration with the structure. \r\n\r\nd.   UAV Launcher. Preliminary design calculations are completed for pneumatic circuit and pulley assembly. The structural design of same is under progress. Local industry is engaged for the manufacturing of the pneumatic actuator in lines with the INTELL design.\r\n\r\n\r\n2.   Hardware Procurement Status.\r\n\r\na.   Order is placed for procurement of JetCat P-1000, Germany based 1100N turbo jet engine, JetCat P-1000 has been finilised. The procurement case is under process at NRDI since 4th Sep 20.\r\n\r\nb.   Veronte Flight controller of M/s Embention has been finalized. Quotations for avionics and related ground equipment have been acquired from M/s Embention, Spain. The procurement case is being initiated. \r\n\r\nc.   Different Material samples for manufacturing different parts of airframe are being procured. Airframe material will be finalized based on destructive testing (DT) & Non Destructive Testing (NDT). The testing will be carried out using NRDI NDT center PNEC and PCSIR equipment.\r\n\r\n3.   Way Forward. Detailed structure design activities for airframe components along with material testing of samples will be carried out. The outcome of the activities will lead towards the critical design integration and design review / revision plan prior to design finalization activities.	DSensors	Cancelled	2020-10-07 12:10:25	20	Sep 20	-20-25-20-	\N	f	\N
