250001	154	2020-09-01 15:06:36	1.   The project was presented to CNS in 2nd R and D board meeting held on 17 April 2020. CNS was briefed about successful installation of VA system at PNS JAUHAR and its associated feedback. The chair directed that the utility of VA system in PN be worked out by NHQ and keep NRDI in loop during the decision process.\r\n\r\n2.   Queries/ observations related to the VA system were received from Dir Security (Ops). NHQ letter PN/Security Ops Dte/03/2278956 dated 13 April 2020 refers.\r\n\r\n3.   Comprehensive reply of each query has been provided from system development perspective. PI letter PN/DG NRDI/R AND D Wing/03/5286224 dated 27 April 2020 refers.\r\n\r\n4.   Requirement of integration of VA system with SNIDs as a 2-step verification process was received from Dir Security (Ops). NHQ letter PN/Security Ops Dte/03/2287914 dated 21 April 2020 refers. To initiate the process, it will essentially require on-site support from SNIDs technical team and details w.r.t SNIDs hardware, networking, database etc. Project PI discussed the requirement with SNIDs technical team member at M/s Horizon Tech Services, Islamabad on 28 Apr 2020. To proceed further, it requires visit of SNIDs technical team at RDW/ PNS JAUHAR so as to understand installed VA system technical contours, site attributes and integration requirements. As informed by the SNIDs technical team member, at present there is no representation of SNIDs technical team at south, so the said visit will be scheduled sooner travelling and related factors w.r.t COVID-19 pandemic situation, are supportive/ settled. PI letter PN/DG NRDI/R AND D Wing/03/5318408 dated 30 April 2020 refers.\r\n\r\n5.   As directed by Director Cyber Security, cyber security team from PNS Karsaz visited RDW on 29 April 2020 to study and recommend deployment strategy and any associated cyber security aspects of the project. NHQ letter PN/CYBER SECURITY/Dte03/2294814 dated 28 April 2020 refers. The team was briefed