opped.\r\n\r\nh.   Material Testing. Destructive Testing (DT) of composite material samples is being carried out using PNEC and PCSIR equipment. Tensile tests and first phase of bending tests are completed. Manufacturing process is improved in lines with the test results. Bending tests of improved samples are under progress. \r\nj.   Wind Tunnel Testing. Computer Aided Design (CAD) model, for development of testing model, has been shared as per the requirements of DESTO.  Estimated of quotation & timeline of 190 working days is received from DESTO. DESTO has been requested to reduce the timeline.\r\n\r\n2.   Hardware Procurement Status.\r\n\r\na.   Order is placed for procurement of JetCat P-1000 (Germany based 1100N) turbo jet engine. The procurement is under progress.\r\n\r\nb.   Order is placed for procurement of Veronte Flight controller of M/s Embention. The procurement is under progress.\r\n\r\nc.   Material for manufacturing of MARLIN-01 UAV and Launcher are being purchased / procured as per the requirement of manufacturing under progress.\r\n\r\nd.   Orders are placed for raw material for MARLIN-02 UAV and Launcher. The procurement is under progress.	DSensors	Edited	2021-06-15 14:54:11	25	May 21	-20-25-	\N	f	\N
