250001	210	2020-10-07 11:21:43	1.   VA project Proof of Concept (PoC) completed. The case file PN wide implementation and related modalities are being processed at NHQ. Case file PN/ Security OPS Dte/02/2954141 dated 31 March 2020 refers. PI comments on the case file have also being provided, as required.\r\n\r\n2.   Visit of SNIDs technical team, M/S Horizon Tech Services (HTS) w.r.t integration of VA with SNIDs was conducted on 12-13 September 2020. Possibility of integration was discussed. The SNIDs team suggested to provide a standalone feed of their server independent of the main SNIDs system. M/S HTS will forward the technical reply by 30 September 2020. It was initially not part of project scope. However, as per suggestion made by the Competent authority, viability is being ascertained in coordination with M/S HTS.\r\n\r\n3.   Module wise cyber security check of VA system has been completed. Observations have been received and being worked on by ET Div as per the guidance received from CyberSoC at PNS KARSAZ. As per the project deliverables and perceived URD, the VA system PoC was to be installed independently in selected units, thereby, not requiring centralized architecture and cyber readiness. However, while processing the VA PoC user feedback on related casefile at NHQ, inclusion of cyber security aspects was proposed. Accordingly, NHQ directed to evaluate installed VA system w.r.t cyber security vide letter PN/Security Ops Dte/03/2278956 dated 13 Apr 2020.	DEnab	Edited	2020-10-12 11:28:23	38	Sep 20	-20-25-20-25-30-38-	-20-25-20-	f	\N
