350005	273	2020-11-30 11:55:40	1.   Design Activities.\r\n\r\na.   Detailed structural analysis is performed on the critical design of HSTD using methods of Finite Element Analysis (FEA). The results showed minimum factor of safety of 2.0 under the maximum ‘g’ loading on the structure. \r\n\r\nb.   In order to test the HST design concept and assess efficacy of various manufacturing techniques a Scaled Down Model (SDM) of the HSTD is being designed. The SDM will be loaded with different sensors / gauges for the acquisition of stress, vibration, temperature data during the test flights. \r\n\r\nc.   The preliminary design activities of SDM-HSTD including geometric scaling and engine selection are completed. Detailed structural design of wing, empennage and fuselage is under progress.\r\n\r\nd.   Detailed design test bench for P-1000 turbo jet engine is under progress. The test bench will serve the purpose of ground testing engine / tuning of various operating parameters prior to integration with airframe.\r\n\r\ne.   UAV Launcher. The critical phase of pneumatic system and structural design is completed. The structural analysis of the designed structure and pneumatic system using FEA based techniques is under progress. Local industry is engaged for the manufacturing of the pneumatic actuator in lines with the INTELL design.\r\n\r\n2.   Hardware Procurement Status.\r\n\r\na.   Order is placed for procurement of JetCat P-1000 (Germany based 1100N) turbo jet engine. The procurement is under progress. \r\n\r\nb.   Orders are placed for procurement of Veronte Flight controller of M/s Embention, Spain. The procurement is under progress.\r\n\r\nc.   Orders are placed for material samples for manufacturing different parts of airframe and procurement is under progress. Airframe material will be finalized based on destructive testing (DT) & Non Destructive Testing (NDT). The testing will be carried out using NRDI NDT center PNEC and PCSIR equipment. \r\n\r\n3.   Way Forward. \r\n\r\na.   Testing of sample materials for airframe components will be carried out. The outcome of these activities will lead towards the 2nd iteration of critical design activities and design review / revision prior to design finalization activities. \r\n\r\nb.   Modifications / improvements in the critical design of HSTD will be undertaken in lines with the outcomes of development and field testing of SDM-HSTD.\r\n\r\nc.   Ground testing of turbo-jet engine will be performed. An avionics test bench will be designed for the setup and integration of both onboard and ground avionics.	DSensors	Edited	2020-12-28 11:34:49	25	Nov 20	-20-25-	\N	f	\N
