350005	507	2021-07-30 17:05:11	\r\n1.   Design / Development Activities.\r\n\r\na.   Manufacturing of MARLIN-01 airframe, assembly and integration with engine, control system, data links are complete. Finishing and paint activities are also completed. \r\n\r\nb.   UAV Launcher. Design and manufacturing of MARLIN-01 Launcher / pneumatic circuit testing bench are complete. Environment projected paint and finishing activities are also completed. \r\n\r\nc.   Jet Engine Testing. Manufacturing and assembly of test bench for P-1000 and P-220 turbo jet engine is completed. P220 Turbo jet engine (for MARLIN-01) is successfully tested for thrust and operating temperatures over varying throttle settings. \r\n\r\nd.   UAV Launcher Testing.   Initial testing of launcher with integrated control system and pneumatic circuit at low and medium pressure are successfully completed. Field testing for dead weight and dummy UAV launcher are also planned at PN GHARO facility. Co-ordination for relevant permission is under progress.\r\n \r\ne.   Systems Integration Testing. Propulsion, control mechanism, avionics, data links and airframe integration test are completed. The tests showed successful transmission of tele-commands over the data links. Engine remote start and control surface deflection also tested successfully. Moreover, integration of UAV with launcher carriage assembly is also tested for clearances.  \r\n\r\nf.   MARLIN-01 Backup. Manufacturing of Marlin-01 backup is also initiated. Machining of structural parts and curing of airframe skin are completed. \r\n\r\ng.   Design of MARLIN-02 (full scaled HSTD). The design is being revised based on the learnings from design / manufacturing activities of MARLIN-01. Detailed design of airframe and integration with launch / recovery systems are also completed. Modifications pertaining to feasibility of manufacturing of molds / patterns are under progress. \r\n\r\nh.   MARLIN-02 launcher. Design of MARLIN-02 launcher is being redesigned based on the learning from design / development of MARLIN-01 Launcher. In this regard, imperative consideration is being given to weight reduction, ease of assembly and transportation. Manufacturing of customized high pneumatic actuator through local industry is also completed. \r\n\r\nj.   Material Testing. Destructive Testing (DT) of composite material samples is being carried out using PNEC and PCSIR equipment. Tensile tests and first phase of bending tests are completed. Manufacturing process is improved in lines with the test results. Bending tests of improved samples are under progress. Also, testing of different composite coring materials is being planned.\r\n\r\nk.   Wind Tunnel Testing. Computer Aided Design (CAD) model, for development of testing model, has been shared as per the requirements of DESTO.  Estimated of quotation & timeline of 190 working days is received from DESTO. DESTO has been requested to reduce the timeline.\r\n\r\n2.   Hardware Procurement Status.\r\n\r\na.   JetCat P-1000 (Germany based 1100N) turbo jet engine, EDD Aug 21\r\nb.   Veronte Flight controller of M/s Embention\r\nc.   Raw material for MARLIN-02 UAV and launcher\r\nd.   Material for finishing of MARLIN-01 UAV and launcher (as per manufacturing requirements)	DSensors	Finalized	2021-08-27 14:04:15	25	Jul 21	-20-25-	\N	f	\N
