350009	633	2022-01-02 15:48:24	\r\n1.   Testing Exercises. EH-01 testing exercises were executed to test efficacy of all deployed EH-01 systems vide NHQ Letter PN/SECURITY OPS DTE/03/3143226 dated 28 Aug 21. Following observations were reported vide Letter PN/HQ COASTAL COMMAND/03/I0724465 dated 05 Oct 21. Point recommended to be dropped.\r\na.   GPS jamming was found satisfactory. \r\nb.   Tele-command jamming was found intermittent.\r\n\r\n2.   EH-01 Trial Scenario. Trials were conducted without considering threat scenario. The tests were conducted while operator and UAV were in close range. Typically, operators don’t jam beyond 1 km due to following. Point recommended to be dropped. \r\na.   RTH function is not available due to jamming.\r\nb.   Operators’ concerns with supply chain of DJI Mavic.\r\n\r\n3.   Presentation on Threat Scenarios. Dir. Sensors presented threat scenario details to DCNS(M) and DCNS(O) dated 22nd Oct 21. Alternate test/ exercise methodology is also proposed to all concerned units. Point recommended to be dropped.\r\n\r\n4.   EH-01 Warranty. All deliverables and technical milestones of EH-01 have been successfully completed. The project is under warranty period, ending in May 22. NRDI INTELL teams have been readily available and active in maintenance/ troubleshooting activities during warranty period. Unit/site-wise details of received OPDEF and defect mitigation strategy by NRDI team are given below:\r\n\r\na.   LSS-14. Point recommended to be dropped. \r\n(1)   Reported Defect. GPS jamming was reported to be in-effective.\r\n(2)   Rectification. The GPS jamming antenna was found to be broken. Subsequently, new GPS jamming antenna was provided.\r\n(3)   Status. EH-01 System operational. Drone Jamming Exercise found satisfactory up to 2107m vide Ref PN/HQ COASTAL COMMAND/ 03/11905616 dated 28 Dec 2021\r\n\r\nb.   3rd FP, GWADAR. Point recommended to be dropped.\r\n(1)   Reported Defect. Tele-command Jamming was reported to be intermittent.\r\n(2)   Rectification. RF cable from PA to Front panel was found defective. Subsequently, the RF cable replaced.\r\n(3)   Current Status. EH-01 System operational.\r\n\r\nc.   6th FP, ORMARA. Point recommended to be dropped.\r\n(1)   Reported Defect. Tele-command Jamming was reported to be intermittent.\r\n(2)   Rectification. No physical defect was observed. The defect was mitigated through Software Patch update.\r\n(3)   Current Status. EH-01 System operational.\r\n\r\nd.   PNAD, PNS AATISH. Point recommended to be dropped.\r\n(1)   Reported Defect. Tele-command Jamming was reported to be intermittent.\r\n(2)   Rectification. No physical defect was observed. The defect was mitigated through software Patch update.\r\n(3)   Current Status. EH-01 System operational.\r\n\r\ne.   LSS LIAQUAT. Point recommended to be dropped.\r\n(1)   Reported Defect. GPS & Tele-command jamming was reported to be non-operational.\r\n(2)   Rectification. GPS and Tele-command PA were found to be defective. Moreover, Tele-command and GPS jamming antenna were also found to be broken. Subsequently, the GPS and Tele-command PA were replaced along with the GPS and Tele-command jamming antenna.\r\n(3)   Current Status. EH-01 system operational.\r\n\r\nf.   1st FP, NRC ISB. \r\n(1)   Reported Defect. GPS jamming is reported to be non-operational\r\n(2)   Rectification. GPS antenna was found broken. The GPS PA was also found electrically damaged. Subsequently, rectification team along with spare GPS PA and antenna was sent to ISB in Dec 21.\r\n(3)   Current Status. EH-01 system operational.\r\n\r\ng.   LSS LIAQUAT. \r\n(1)   Reported Defect. Tele-command jamming was reported to be non-operational in Dec 21.\r\n(2)   Rectification. Tele-command PA was found to be defective. Subsequently, the Tele-command PA was replaced.\r\n(3)   Current Status. EH-01 system operational.	DSensors	Finalized	2022-01-04 14:44:54	25	Dec 21	-20-25-	\N	f	\N
