oject proposal will be submitted by 30 June 2020 for approval.\r\n  The Chair also directed to carry out feasibility study for development of Simulator for Torpedo Launching Tubes (STLT) project using Virtual Reality (VR) technology by R&D Wing. ITD Wing has forwarded the URD of STLT for feasibility study vide memo PN/DITD S/01/2207542 dated 21 April 2020. RDW ET Div team is evaluating the requirement and visited STC on 28th and 30th April 2020. With present COVID-19 pandemic situation, confirmation on availability and estimated pricing of related commercial grade immersive technology hardware in local and international market is complex and taking more time than usual. Feasibility study will be prepared and forwarded by RDW ET Div accordingly.	DEnab	Finalized	2020-06-09 14:20:22	30	May 20	-20-25-30-	\N	f	\N
