200002	172	2020-09-07 13:17:49	a.   A committee was formed by NHQ to assess the performance of Link-Y with DVBS. The committee formulated detailed SOPs with screenshots of each step and shared the SOPs with ships. Subsequently, extensive trials were conducted from 3rd Aug to 6th Aug 2020. In addition to MHQ, all ships with operational Link-Y participated in the exercise. The ships were PNS SAIF, PNS ASLAT and PNS TARIQ. The trials remained satisfactory and 100% tracks were received successfully by all participating units. Frequent utilization of Link-Y with DVBS has been recommended by the committee.\r\n\r\nb.   Out of the 05 Platforms earmarked for Phase-4, PNS TARIQ was available and has been tested successfully. Link-Y is not available on remaining 04 ships due to various defects. Testing of Link Y - DVBS devices will be done on these platforms as soon as respective Link-Y systems become available.	DCom	Finalized	2020-09-08 12:44:58	30	Aug 20	-20-25-30-20-25-30-	-20-25-30-20-	f	\N
