250001	156	2020-09-01 15:13:28	1.   VA project PoC completed. The case file PN wide implementation and related modalities are being processed at NHQ. Case file PN/ Security OPS Dte/02/2954141 dated 31 March 2020 refers. PI comments on the case file have also being provided, as required.\r\n2.   Visit of SNIDs technical team (M/S HTS) w.r.t integration of VA with SNIDs is expected in September 2020.\r\n3.   Module wise cyber security check of VA system is in progress.\r\n\r\nAny Other Update:\r\n1.   Vision based Maritime traffic monitoring at Karachi Harbor and Wharf Area\r\n- Vision based Maritime Traffic Monitoring at Karachi Harbor and Wharf area concept was presented by PI (as prospective project for approval in next R and D board) to CNS in 2nd R and D board meeting held on 17 April 2020. The Chair appreciated the concept and gave approval in principal for the project. Project proposal has been submitted to NHQ on 23 June 2020 for further processing. PI letter PN/DG NRDI/R AND D Wing/03/5765186 dated 23 June 2020 refers. Project is under process at NHQ for approval on file. CNS has directed to hold presentation on relevant case file.\r\n\r\n- Recorded video feeds and technical documentation of specialized cameras (SOT2SE/ FLIR/ TI) at Karachi Harbor have been acquired for checking feasibility of integration with proposed system. PI letter PN/DG NRDI/R AND D Wing/03/6130271 refers.\r\n\r\n- Date of presentation is currently awaited.\r\n\r\n2.   Establishment of Virtual Reality Center at Research and Development Wing\r\n- Project concept was presented by the PI (as prospective project for approval in next R and D board) to CNS in 2nd R and D board meeting held on 17 April 2020. The Chair directed that proposal of establishment of Virtual Reality Center be worked out and processed on file. \r\n\r\n- Details for establishing a Virtual Reality Center (VRC) at Research and Development Wing (RDW) were worked out thoroughly. Proposal was submitted to NHQ on 14 July 2020 for further processing. PI letter PN/DG NRDI/R AND D Wing/03/5933147 dated 14 July 2020 refers.\r\n\r\n- Case file has been approved by CNS on 27 August 2020.\r\n\r\n3.   Simulator for Torpedo Launching Tubes (STLT) for submarines\r\n- In connection with Virtual Reality Center, CNS during 2nd R and D board meeting directed to carry out feasibility study for development of simulator for Torpedo launching tubes (STLT) project using Virtual Reality (VR) technology by R&D wing. \r\n\r\n- Team from ET Division at RDW NRDI visited Submarine Training Center (STC), to understand the underlying dynamics. Preliminary analysis as per the URD was conducted for:\r\n•   Possibility of mapping of mentioned requirements and base scenarios using VR\r\n•   Possibility of using mixed reality tools\r\n•   HR requirements\r\n•   Hardware requirements\r\n\r\n- Subsequently, feasibility study was submitted on 17 July 2020. PI letter PN/DG NRDI/R AND D wing/03/6017486 dated 17 July 2020 refers.\r\n\r\n- URD of VR-based simulator for STLT has been developed at STC with support from ET Div.	DEnab	Finalized	2020-09-07 12:22:05	30	Aug 20	-20-25-30-	\N	f	\N
