t. Point recommended to be dropped.\r\n\r\na.   Queries regarding electrical panel design along with the preliminary panel for Hydraulic pump have been forwarded to DY team. Once approved and accepted by DY team, the electrical panel will be implemented by NRDI INTELL.\r\n\r\nb.   FATs for HPAC VFDs are successfully completed. HPAC VFDs will be handed over to PND on 7 Dec 21 for workshop trials.\r\n\r\n8.   Documentation Finalization. INTELL NRDI team has developed documents including technical and operating manuals, based on provided feedback from DY team. Documentation draft was sent to PN dockyard for approval and generally considered accepted. However, minor suggestions from PND are received, vide reference PN/PN DOCKYARD/S/M WING/GM (ME S/M WING) / 03/12388607 dated 18 Feb 22. The same are being rectified by INTELL team.\r\n\r\n9.   Troubleshooting Support to PND. Following support and troubleshooting activities were carried out during Feb 22:\r\n\r\na.   PN Dockyard raised the RPM issue regarding DM and DY application which was resolved by NRDI INTELL on 8th Feb 2022 vide reference PN/PN DOCKYARD/S/M WING/GM (ME S/M WING) / 03/12198542 dated 01 Feb 22. On-site support was provided to resolve the reported issue.\r\n\r\nb.   PN Dockyard raised the issue for blank keypad display which was resolved by NRDI INTELL on 16th Feb 2022.\r\n\r\nc.   Cooling pump (DK1) issue on local mode was raised by PN dockyard. The issue was resolved by NRDI INTELL team through remote support.\r\n\r\n\r\n10.   Sea Acceptance Trials. The Sea Acceptance Trials (SAT) of NRDI developed VFDs installed onboard PNS KHALID are currently in progress.	DSensors	Cancelled	2022-04-27 02:32:55	19	Apr 22	-19-	\N	f	\N
