250005	697	2022-04-30 00:11:29	1.   The case file for PN wide implementation of VA project and its related modalities has been processed at NHQ and approved by the competent authority. Project amounting Rs 78M have been approved. Case file PN/ Security OPS Dte/02/2954141 dated 31 March 2020 refers. \r\n\r\n2.   VA system will be integrated with SNIDs Phase-II in 13 x PN units (Priority I & II).\r\n\r\n3. Transfer of 10 x members of Video Analytics (VA) Project Expansion and Support Team (VAPEST) to NRDI has also been approved for the project. In this regard 01 x IT officer, 01 x CWEA and 03 x WEMs have reported for Pilot VA-SNIDs Integration project; whereas, remaining members will be transferred for PN wide VA-SNIDs Integration after successful implementation of pilot project.\r\n\r\n4.  Coordination meeting among all stakeholders of VA-SNIDs integration project was tentatively scheduled in last week of June 2021 at NHQ. D Sec (Ops) letter PN/Security Ops Dte/03/2995695 dated 11 June 2021 refers. However, the same could not be conducted. Fresh date for meeting was requested by Dir ET vide Letter PN/ DG NRDI/R AND D Wing/03/9516278 dated 18 June 2021.\r\n\r\n5.      The initial survey of 13 x PN units (Priority I & II) w.r.t C&CC location, available network, SNIDs Phase – II working, hardware requirements etc has been completed.\r\n\r\n6.         A comprehensive report of the survey as mentioned above has been forwarded to D Security (Ops). PI letter PN/DG NRDI/R AND D Wing/03/10049564 dated 16 Aug 2021 refers.	DEnab	Edited	2022-05-21 00:10:11	19	Apr 22	-19-25-19-	\N	f	\N
