350010	1016	2023-08-07 16:19:25.05	1.   Milestones Completion.\r\n\r\n       a.   Project has been successfully completed vide reference GM ME S/M/PGD/308-KHA/ 38 dated 29 Jul 22. \r\n\r\n       b.   The project warranty is completed on 29 Jul 23.\r\n\r\n2.   Installation and repair of VFD.\r\n\r\n       a.   01 x complete system of Variable Frequency Drive (EVD-45KL) for Air Conditioner has been delivered and made operational onboard PNSM Hamza vide reference letters PN/ S/M WING/MAINTENANCE/3840835 dated 09 APR 23 and PN/NRDI/MAINTENANCE/3944122 DATED 17 APR 23. PND staff was also engaged during the installation and development activities of the VFD with NRDI INTELL team to enable the relevant maintenance staff in undertaking rectification of the system independently in the future. \r\n\r\n       b.   A 01 x NRDI INTELL developed VFD (EX-FREC) of PNS HAMZA was received at NRDI INTELL for defect diagnostic and rectification, vide reference letter PN/ S/M WING/MAINTENANCE/4745597 dated 09 Jun 23. Subsequently, after inspection and diagnosis of the VFD, defective components were replaced on urgent basis and VFD was made available, vide reference letter PN/R AND D WING/GENERAL/4793551 dated 11 Jun 23.\r\n\r\n3.   Provision of VFD Spares list. NRDI INTELL shared a complete list of recommended spares for storage in depot and carrying onboard with PN Dockyard vide references PN/R AND D WING/GENERAL/3761014 dated 05 Apr 23. However, PN Dockyard requested for the provision of VFD spares list including price and procurement source, vide reference letter PN/S/M WING/MAINTENANCE/428441 dated 17 Jul 23. The revised list is being compiled at NRDI INTELL. List will include three types of spares: spares/components that are available locally, spares that will be procured from different OEMs, and the items that will be manufactured at NRDI INTELL.	DSensors	Under Finalization	\N	25	Jul 23	-19-25-	\N	f	\N
