350012	1057	2023-10-06 12:08:03.383	Progress\r\n\r\n1.   Training Of Personnel. In order to induct the pilot RUL work in PN, a need was felt to develop a core team which could continue the peculiar work for other mission critical systems in PN as well. Accordingly, trainees among those nominated by field Units were interviewed/ shortlisted. Composition of Units described by NHQs for training was adhered, while formulating the core team. Additionally, it was opined essential to train the team on all aspects of the RUL project. Accordingly, 14 x Personnel (from NCMA, FMG (WE), FMG (ME), RD & TA, W&S, S & S, SW and ITRF) were shortlisted and trained for Operation/ Installation and Maintenance, from 04 Sep 23 to 15 Sep 23.\r\n\r\n2.   GUI Development. The Graphical User Interface (GUI) pertaining to the developed framework has been updated based on the received feedback during training and vide letter PN/NCMA/PROJECTS/1036919 dated 31 Aug 23. \r\n\r\n3.   Documentation. The documentation of the project has been updated based on the received feedback vide letter PN/NCMA/PROJECTS/1036919 dated 31 Aug 23. The documentation of the project has been forwarded to MTSS as well as NCMA vide PN/R AND D WING/GENERAL/1320116 Dated 28 Sep 23. The document (4-NRDI-RULMANUAL-08100-001-000-0) saliently covers theoretical concepts, Operation of the RUL framework, data acquisition, uploading, diagnosis, prognosis and RUL estimation.  \r\n\r\n4.   Acceptance. Deployment and acceptance of the complete system along with all deliverables planned in Oct 23.	DSensors	Finalized	2023-10-30 11:46:28.947	25	Sep 23	-19-25-	\N	f	\N
