350024	1150	2024-01-15 16:18:46.318	Progress\r\n\r\n1.   Submission of Project Plan and List of Deliverables. The "Project Plan and List of Deliverables" has been submitted against Milestone M2. The same has been forwarded to MTSS for invoice and onward submission.\r\n\r\n2.   Submission of Design Report & Drawings. Design of Radome assembly has been completed. Structural analysis for verification of design is also completed. A report encompassing the design details is submitted, against Milestone M4. The same has been forwarded to MTSS for invoice and onward submission. \r\n\r\n3.   Manufacturing of Radome and Base. Manufacturing of these parts in line with already developed detailed drawings has been completed. The developed parts have been sent to PND for acceptance testing, against Milestone M6. Through pressure testing, the structural integrity of Radome has been qualified. The initial design of Radome also successfully resisted water ingress up-to 44 bar pressure. However, water ingress is observed at 45 bar pressure. Design upgradations have been made in the material of Radome base, its thread size, location and size of seal groove. After design updates, the Radome has successfully passed ingress protection at 45 bar pressure.\r\n\r\n4.   Handover and Testing. The pressure (45 bar for 1 hour) and RF testing is successfully conducted. The developed Radome has been handed over to PND for acceptance. Moreover, duly endorsed completion certificate of milestones 6 & 8 were received vide letter PN/GM(W AND S S/M)/GENERAL/1427372 Dated 13 Oct 23.	DSensors	Finalized	2024-02-01 12:44:27.724	25	Dec 23	-19-25-	\N	f	\N
