350014	1200	2024-03-12 12:12:14.027	Progress\r\n\r\n1.   The complete Raven II system has been successfully deployed onboard PNS MOAWIN for LWF held on 28 - 29 Oct 22. The project has been successfully completed. The project warranty is also completed.\r\n\r\n2.   Complete system was handed over by PNS MOAWIN to NRDI INTELL on 16 Feb 23 for training of PN personnel. 03 x days operator and maintenance training sessions on the developed Raven-II system have been imparted by NRDI INTELL team from 20-22 Jun 23 vide reference PN/ R AND D WING/GENERAL/4996456 dated 24 Jun 23. \r\n\r\n3.   NRDI INTELL successfully tested SSDLS antenna at Suparco SRDC-Lahore using GSP Testbench indigenously developed by NRDI INTELL. Feasibility Report of the tested system has been submitted vide letter (PN/R AND D WING/GENERAL/6016051 dated 06 Nov 23).\r\n\r\n4.   Formulation of PMS/MMS routines (Job Information Card (JICs)) requested vide reference letter (PN/COMAUXMIN 9/MAINTANANCE/5444776 dated 26 Sep 23). In response NRDI forwarded PMS/MMS routines (Job Information Card (JICs)) of complete RAVEN II system vide reference letter PN/ R AND D WING/GENERAL/6801319 dated 08 Jan 24. Moreover, installation and ground test of complete system were successfully done onboard PNS MOAWIN on 5 Jan 24 for LWF (SS-24) subsequently system was handed over to WEO MOWAIN. Harbor and sea trials were also held with PC flight on 21 Jan 24 and 23 Jan 24 respectively.	DSensors	Finalized	2024-03-27 09:40:06.919	25	Feb 24	-19-25-	\N	f	\N
