350012	1232	2024-04-09 09:43:58.866	Progress \r\n\r\n1.   Training of Personnel: 14 x Personnel (from NCMA, FMG (WE), FMG (ME), RD & TA, W&S, S & S, SW and ITRF) were earmarked and trained for Operation/ Installation and Maintenance, from 04 Sep 23 to 15 Sep 23.\r\n\r\n2.   GUI Development. The Graphical User Interface (GUI) pertaining to the developed framework has been updated based on the received feedback during training and vide letter PN/NCMA/PROJECTS/1036919 dated 31 Aug 23. \r\n\r\n3.   Documentation. The documentation of the project has been updated based on the received feedback vide letter PN/NCMA/PROJECTS/1036919 dated 31 Aug 23. The documentation of the project has been forwarded to MTSS as well as NCMA vide PN/R AND D WING/GENERAL/1320116 dated 28 Sep 23. The document (4-NRDI-RULMANUAL-08100-001-000-0) saliently covers theoretical concepts, Operation of the RUL framework, data acquisition, uploading, diagnosis, prognosis and RUL estimation.  \r\n\r\n4.   Acceptance. ATPs were conducted on 07 Dec 23, subsequently feedback/observations were received from NCMA against conducted ATPs vide letter PN/NCMA/PROJECTS/6499087 dated 13 Dec 23. In response NRDI wrote a detailed response of received observation vide letter PN/ R AND D WING/PROJECTS/6595648 dated 19 Dec 23. A meeting was held on 11 Jan 24 between NCMA, FMG and NRDI for clarification of response sent by NRDI. Moreover, acceptance from NCMA has been received vide PN/NCMA/PROJECTS/7020919 dated 31 Jan 24 and is under process at NHQs. Hardware (2 x PCs, 6 x Data loggers, 01 x DVD) against Milestone-9 also ready for delivery. However, NCMA has requested to hold hardware provision till acceptance of the Milestone-6 by NHQs. NCMA letter PN/NCMA/PROJECTS/7627804 dated 29 Feb 2024 and NRDI letter PN/R AND D WING/GENERAL/7546684 dated 24 Feb 24 refers.	DSensors	Finalized	2024-05-02 12:20:44.745	25	Mar 24	-19-25-	\N	f	\N
